# Production database — machine-local, never version-controlled.
# prod.db is created at install time by copying the tracked dev.db seed
# (see INSTALLER_PACKAGE_MANIFEST.md); it then diverges with real inspection
# data that must not enter git history. dev.db itself stays TRACKED — it is
# this repo's seed/reference database, committed via chore(dev.db) commits.
prod.db
prod.db-journal
prod.db-wal
prod.db-shm
